    Verbatim from apps/apple-plugin/src/Bridge.luau, the shipped artifact:
      “Invalid or expired pairing code.”                       (was “Invalid or expired code”)
      “Could not reach Apple — check Studio’s network permission.”
                                                        (was “— check your internet”)
    The three other quotes on this page — “Session ended — reconnect with a new code” and
